{"data": {"id": "47dca55df2eb6cb2a0c245705ac3a7e94096335594ecdbe5a4bd3f86a27cf0fb", "lineage": "47dca55df2eb6cb2a0c245705ac3a7e94096335594ecdbe5a4bd3f86a27cf0fb", "origin": "sample:3", "parent": null, "source": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic final class Solution {\n    public static Object solve(Map<String,Object> data) {\n        int n = ((Number) data.get(\"n\")).intValue();\n        int k = ((Number) data.get(\"k\")).intValue();\n        \n        if (n == 1 || k == 1) return 1;\n        \n        List<Integer> people = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) people.add(i);\n        \n        while (people.size() > 1) {\n            for (int i = 0; i < people.size(); i += k - 1) {\n                if (i + k - 1 >= people.size()) {\n                    people.remove(0);\n                } else {\n                    people.remove(i + k - 1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        return people.get(0);\n    }\n}"}, "kind": "candidate", "prev": "2308cf092f6c61ff242994c7890eb0d47db8f2a42ed42f82b2876df16ea788ab", "seq": 22}
